meta {
  name: Approve Space Restore
  type: http
  seq: 11
}

post {
  url: {{backendUrl}}/api/space/restore-request/approve
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

docs {
  The member who did not ask for the restore approves it and it runs in one
  transaction. A pre-restore snapshot of the current state is taken first
  (safety_backup_id). 409 for the member who asked, 404 when no restore
  waits or it expired (24 hours).
}
